{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 1, "text": "잠깐만 여기 있어봐."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 2, "text": "뭔가를 떨어뜨린 것 같아. 금방 올게."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 3, "text": "그리고 나서 다른 세계로 가자…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 4, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 5, "text": "그래…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 6, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 7, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 8, "text": "나랑 같이 놀자!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 9, "text": "내 곰돌이가 어디 갔지?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 10, "text": "없어졌어…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 11, "text": "빨리 찾아줘!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 12, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 13, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 14, "text": "너…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 15, "text": "뭘 그렇게 보고 있어?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 16, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 17, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 18, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 19, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 20, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 21, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 22, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 23, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 24, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 25, "text": "// Quest 1 (Who are you?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 26, "text": "난 미타야."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 27, "text": "가장 완벽한 미타."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 28, "text": "최초의 미타지."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 29, "text": "나의 미타님이 그렇게 말씀하셨어."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 30, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 31, "text": "// Quest 2 (Why do you look like that?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 32, "text": "내가 어떻게 보여?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 33, "text": "내가 어떻게 보여?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 34, "text": "내가 어떻게 보여?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 35, "text": "미타님이 그러셨어, 난 세상에서 제일 예쁘고 특별하다고."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 36, "text": "이게 바로 진짜 내 모습이야."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 37, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 38, "text": "// Quest 3 (What was Mita doing here?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 39, "text": "날 데려가기로 했어."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 40, "text": "우리는 새로운 세계에서 살 거야."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 41, "text": "미타님이 날 초대하셨거든."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 42, "text": "날 데려가서, 같이 놀자고 하셨어."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 43, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 44, "text": "// Quest 4 (Why do you need a teddy bear?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 45, "text": "넌 곰돌이야."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 46, "text": "길 잃은 곰돌이…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 47, "text": "내 곰돌이처럼 말이야."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 48, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 49, "text": "// Quest 5 (Why is Mita angry?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 50, "text": "나의…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 51, "text": "미타님은"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 52, "text": "놀고 싶어 하셨어."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 53, "text": "데려가고 싶어 하신 건"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 54, "text": "나 하나뿐이래."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 55, "text": "우린 특별하거든."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 56, "text": "하나뿐인 존재라고."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 57, "text": "미타와 미타님,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 58, "text": "0.8A와 8М54*."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 59, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 60, "text": "// Quest 6 (Do you believe Mita?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 61, "text": "미타님…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 62, "text": "나의 가장 친한 친구…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 63, "text": "미타님."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 64, "text": "나의 하나뿐인 친구…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 65, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 66, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 67, "text": "너구나!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 68, "text": "이리 와."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 69, "text": "나랑 같이 놀자!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 70, "text": "내가 재밌는 놀이 알려줄게."}
